{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_10003_01_d",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:691d1dc0fe4d2c42ec6e91e24121a70c6d5bdd32dc47969ecd2151e578a9f389",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_d:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:199b66edd91b782f56e8f452b5749de9ed229fc715f6f8425d3cb63228b443f3",
      "text": "上面写着“这是以Cafe Parade那般\n个性洋溢的光芒为灵感创作的同人作品”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_d:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:891478c3749a968fa99f341084eb8d65f3444e539fb9395387d3b9774e221d6f",
      "text": "啊！这位设计师，\n我之前就觉得名字好像在哪里见过……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_d:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:317b8fee26a811d0d48b60860027e6a4616b111f45d02c3a5d2516bdc875a74f",
      "text": "最近在社交平台上超级有话题度哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_d:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e06265980dc9b5d619eb200481fc51399db8c793f8fa65bd3965af92dcefa61",
      "text": "是新晋新锐的珠宝艺术家吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_d:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:35d0455f5212d4251edb7beeaa84dc90c85c82815f5cf3f96905c92a16698a02",
      "text": "能为我们制作同人作品，真开心啊。\n真想向对方传达感谢的心情呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_d:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20d82a5d94ad80e60a51d15a33b93f95f6928720f25e09b4bd1dc6720a74e1ab",
      "text": "但是，如果突然收到本人发来的评论，\n对方会不会吓一跳呀？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_d:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5fc0a6d8623455ec720b97f9b0e7387124722d27218a7735c69db0ceb4643fac",
      "text": "……既然如此，至少留下感谢的刻印吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_d:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:52bd743070129038203d8172fb452c5931780a42983e4354044aed41c5dee8eb",
      "text": "原来如此，是点一个“赞！”啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_d:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e81d038e53d4764fd45604334a8974286dfda494d5ee9ff79eed5d572f6bb023",
      "text": "呵呵，要是能被设计师注意到\n那就太好了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_d:cmd-000132:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f2fbb1a02889ca49aa7b06568f055b3fa95c139a4c0b8a663c4ad6b64d4b865",
      "text": "各位辛苦了。\n大家都在呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_d:cmd-000150:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:646f1b991276553482d6df4b3668484e549173691fd260961bffd0baa9ffd3ef",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，辛苦了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_d:cmd-000156:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:22ed5c023e5bc35e6c7451e18950d7c60fdb5fbd7ed01180e3cb83389e108487",
      "text": "呐呐快听我说！\n刚才发生了一件超级厉害的事！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_d:cmd-000171:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7823f8c3b6be94411f17c1968ba69b64e83c516fdefe2ddece84d5a8321a6435",
      "text": "当天夜里……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_d:cmd-000179:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf02505a7a8f97b6920af0788d05047339204e996606ebba3bcd374ff016f1fc",
      "text": "是主吗？\n方才未能接听实在抱歉。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_d:cmd-000181:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:864983dc0bb4fef986f6a5c72cdd2b58e15d3a25db62d4c35361f9299ab8c2fd",
      "text": "吾方才正精炼暗之供物。\n话说回来，吾主唤吾何事？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_d:cmd-000183:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:926d2e6aa3723fe03ddca4482db3af47f93a012b8dffb97fff5c9dc8408d6531",
      "text": "珠宝设计师\n发来了委托……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_d:cmd-000186:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5378d29aaabf24c457f4959feef0ecaea83fb23220108513cd9b51aae9c279c3",
      "text": "此、此话当真！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_d:cmd-000188:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9efbaf606133624a0d625cb830cefa08639f1a68b0e11e4c505fcc1382cefd20",
      "text": "竟能与精炼彼圆环之人共担试炼……！\n吾之灵魂已兴奋得颤抖不已！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_d:cmd-000190:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c0375251cea030c1692f7b7e458a6e8edd2432597e9ec2eba3abdc87b929e1bf",
      "text": "详情明天在事务所\n当面跟您说吧",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_d:cmd-000193:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b2a60997bf2e009c26722fecf10de48a08b2d6e6483808d64702083c7e9105a1",
      "text": "吾已知晓。神谷亦在此处。\n由吾转告彼即可。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_d:cmd-000195:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4f4f71ce76e4b590af16f24fd58b7eebbf09392318fd8c513c006edb3af24f3",
      "text": "库库，神谷亦必当欢欣雀跃吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_d:cmd-000197:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0c3c06cc70422c3fe27dbe396b9eb62e9944a7b512dfdd2118e8499e6a966fb0",
      "text": "吾主啊，吾静候明日之详谈！\n啊——哈哈哈哈！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
